# NOTE: `private/` is intentionally NOT ignored here — the Dockerfile copies
# it into the runtime image on purpose (Google service account credentials
# are read via fs at runtime, see GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON_PATH in .env).

# Runtime uploads live in a named docker volume mounted at /app/public/media.
# Anything baked in here would just be masked by that mount at runtime.
